From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rnsbox <rnsbox@localhost>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 22:58:01 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 01/16] board: RNSBox Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W skeleton
 (config.txt, gadget flags, kernel fragment, defconfig)

Bootable base on official Buildroot 2026.02.3 LTS with the Raspberry Pi
Foundation kernel (pinned tarball), bootlin aarch64-musl stable toolchain.

- config.txt: headless (gpu_mem=16), Bluetooth disabled so the PL011 on
  GPIO14/15 is free for the 2 Mbaud SLIP HaLow link, no serial console,
  dwc2 in peripheral mode on the micro-USB OTG port.
- post-image: ships the usb.* gadget flag files on the boot FAT (same /boot
  flag semantics as the LicheeRV build) + pins cmdline.txt, then runs the
  stock genimage sdcard assembly.
- linux.fragment: NCM/mass-storage gadget, DWC2 dual-role, nftables, SLIP,
  BBR+fq, TUN/VETH on top of bcm2711_defconfig.
